; Reverse zone of the lab range - rendered by gen_lab.py into generated/dns.
; TTL 1 s: see example-a.test.db.
;
; .10 has TWO PTR names (today only the first answer is used, B-04); .11 and .13
; have none (NXDOMAIN); .12's name forward-resolves to the outsider (.99).
$ORIGIN 98.88.192.in-addr.arpa.
$TTL 1
@        IN SOA ns1.example-a.test. hostmaster.example-a.test. @SERIAL@ 3600 600 86400 1
@        IN NS  ns1.example-a.test.
10       IN PTR web.example-a.test.
10       IN PTR app.example-a.test.
12       IN PTR mismatch.example-b.test.
40       IN PTR edge-40.example-b.test.
